{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/a43e335ad01654c7ad740c96c1ba5c78.avif?t=1757495841\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc4 <strong>PROTOCOL EE-3159620 \u2014 INFORMATION FILE FOR TEST SUBJECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sender:</strong> Telescreen Defense Corp \u2014 Department of Cooperative Experiments<br><strong>Recipients:</strong> Voluntary subjects assigned to the <i>EMERGENCY EXIT</i> simulation<br><strong>Subject:</strong> General instructions for participation and obligations</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 <strong>PREAMBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I, the undersigned, voluntary test subject, acknowledge that the <i>EMERGENCY EXIT</i> program (EE-3159620 \u2013\u202f2025) is a cooperative simulation.<br>This simulation evaluates the subjects\u2019 ability to communicate, solve complex problems, and act under pressure in a hostile environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I understand that my chances of success depend exclusively on my coordination with the partner assigned to me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a3 <strong>SIMULATION MODALITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two operators. Two distinct roles. One single exit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Operator\u202f1</strong><br>\u2022 Alone in the corridors of the complex.<br>\u2022 Equipped with a simple flashlight with limited battery.<br>\u2022 Progresses through a dark evacuation plan, exposed to flames, traps, and biological anomalies.<br>\u2022 Must demonstrate orientation, observation, and composure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/e8ff91f72b2fa3f3c1a09b8b5e63ecc6.poster.avif?t=1757495841\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/e8ff91f72b2fa3f3c1a09b8b5e63ecc6.webm?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/e8ff91f72b2fa3f3c1a09b8b5e63ecc6.mp4?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u25a3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a3\u00a0<strong>Operator\u202f2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Confined to the control room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cannot see Operator\u202f1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Guides their partner using the provided emergency manual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controls and monitors the environment to allow progression, while managing the power supply on which the various systems depend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/a6e4f54bd77de8a8bc50a2c02749edc8.poster.avif?t=1757495841\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/a6e4f54bd77de8a8bc50a2c02749edc8.webm?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/a6e4f54bd77de8a8bc50a2c02749edc8.mp4?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c8 <strong>OBJECTIVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2610 Reach the exit before the time runs out.<br>\u2610 Maintain clear and continuous communication.<br>\u2610 Solve the puzzles and challenges encountered together.<br>\u2610 Discover the journals and documents left by previous test subjects.<br>\u2610 Achieve the best scores and surpass other subjects.<br>\u2610 Complete the experience in both roles to finalize your file and validate your contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/029a8fcfb7d6a9820724575b35bd5f09.poster.avif?t=1757495841\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/029a8fcfb7d6a9820724575b35bd5f09.webm?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/029a8fcfb7d6a9820724575b35bd5f09.mp4?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a3 <strong>ADDITIONAL NOTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Several difficulty levels are available (and additional game modes to come).<br>\u2022 Two final outcomes are recorded.<br>\u2022 The simulation contains optional and secret elements to discover.<br>\u2022 The results will be archived in your personal file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/c2f5315ead3ecc8a855a6939116bfaf0.poster.avif?t=1757495841\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/c2f5315ead3ecc8a855a6939116bfaf0.webm?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/c2f5315ead3ecc8a855a6939116bfaf0.mp4?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 <strong>REMARKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Emergency Exit does not offer a traditional tutorial. This is a deliberate choice.</i><br><br><br><br><br><i>The game invites you to discover its mechanics and rules through exploration and experimentation, and rewards curiosity and observation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/b27788b787a7119085388b695f831309.poster.avif?t=1757495841\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/b27788b787a7119085388b695f831309.webm?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/b27788b787a7119085388b695f831309.mp4?t=1757495841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please also confirm your participation by adding this program to your wishlist.<br>Thank you for your cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159620/extras/4085d33945ef66417848463457c6cefb.webp?t=1757495841\" data-has-big width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Emergency Exit Reached","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/bdbe5a98bb8746f7cd2de02d737cb28dd88606b4.jpg"},{"name":"That was close..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/6b6bf594cec68da1b7cb3c51a2407e63eff3ba4a.jpg"},{"name":"It Takes Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3159620/eb0ddbdea8d0c28212f6934285f8f9ce5eded8b1.jpg"},{"name":"Dear diary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun